### 1. 查列表（看看现在有什么）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment/list

### 2. 新增一个
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobName": "一线销售",
  "candidateName": "张三",
  "mobile": "13800138000",
  "interviewerName": "李经理",
  "passed": "待确认",
  "hired": "待确认"
}

### 3. 查列表（确认新增成功）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment/list

### 4. 按 ID 查
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment/2

### 5. 删除
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment/2

### 6. 查列表（确认删掉了）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment/list

### 7. 新增（重复手机号，应该报错）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobName": "二线销售",
  "candidateName": "李四",
  "mobile": "13800138000",
  "interviewerName": "王经理",
  "passed": "待确认",
  "hired": "待确认"
}

### 8. 新增（必填为空，应该报错）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobName": "",
  "candidateName": "",
  "mobile": "",
  "interviewerName": "",
  "passed": "待确认",
  "hired": "待确认"
}

### 9. 查不存在的 ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment/9999

### 10. 按姓名筛选
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment/list?name=张

### 11. 按手机号筛选
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment/list?mobile=138

### 12. 按岗位筛选
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment/list?jobName=销售

### 13. 更新（改通过）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/recruitment/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobName": "一线销售",
  "candidateName": "张三",
  "mobile": "13800138000",
  "interviewerName": "李经理",
  "passed": "是",
  "hired": "待确认"
}